# Left out of the package a release tag publishes.
#
# Warden publishes GitHub's archive of the tag, and GitHub's archive honours
# export-ignore. This list mirrors the exclusions in bin/build-zip.sh, so a tag
# ships the same files that script's zip does. The AGENT.md notes never reach a
# client site this way.
/bin                    export-ignore
/docs                   export-ignore
/.github                export-ignore
AGENT.md                export-ignore
/README.md              export-ignore
/CHANGELOG.md           export-ignore
/ROADMAP.md             export-ignore
/SECURITY.md            export-ignore
/languages/*.po         export-ignore
/languages/*.pot        export-ignore
.gitignore              export-ignore
.gitattributes          export-ignore
